# [SPRING](../wg/spring.html)

## Summary

The SPRING Working Group met during IETF 127. The session was chaired by Joel Halpern. The agenda covered working group administration and document status updates, followed by technical presentations and discussions on ICMP error handling in SRv6 networks, flexible candidate path selection, distributed bandwidth management using RSVP-TE, BGP SR Policy extensions for BFD configuration, SRv6 multipath traffic engineering, time-scheduled color-based SR Policy selection, and quality-aware dynamic adaptive adjustment for SR-TE paths.

